
### `.gitignore`

And keep your `.gitignore` simple and professional:

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build
dist/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Coverage
coverage/

# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp